        "thought_text": "Refine the approach by using numerical optimization techniques instead of a fixed-point iteration method to find the optimal detachment point. Specifically, use a root-finding algorithm like Newton's method to minimize the distance between the target and the spiral curve. This will ensure more accurate convergence to the correct point.",
